
reg_issue1491.fz:26:5: error 1: Must not define type inside of type feature.
    feature_defined_in_type_feature is
----^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
To solve this, move the type outside of the type feature.
E.g., instead of: 
'type.union : Monoid bitset is'
do this: 
public type.union =>
  _ : Monoid bitset

one error.
